<title>USA: Meditrust increases qtly div to $0.7175.</title>
<headline>Meditrust increases qtly div to $0.7175.</headline>
<dateline>NEEDHAM HEIGHTS, Mass. 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meditrust said on Tuesday it increased its quarterly dividend to $0.7175 per share from $0.6975 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend will be paid on August 15 to shareholders of record on July 31.</p>
<p>Meditrust, based in Needham Heights, Mass., is a health care real estate investment trust.</p>
